      "generic_name": "Encryption Key Management",
      "ports": [],
      "data": {
        "description": "Customer-Managed Encryption Keys (CMEK) wrapping Firestore and Qdrant at rest. Represented with zero graph edges by design: an edge from Cloud KMS to Firestore would create a second inbound edge on Firestore, violating the exactly-one-inbound-edge isolation rule. CMEK is instead referenced via the cmek_key_ring metadata field on the Firestore and Qdrant nodes.",
